{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640070","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1064007001:0":{"text":"残る食材は……濃厚な元素エキスね。これが手に入れば、混沌と虚空の暗黒召喚鍋が作れる！","source_cn":"只差最后一种食材——浓郁的元素精华，我们就能制作混沌虚...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064007002:1":{"text":"今回は順調にいくといいな……","source_cn":"希望这次能顺利一点……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x47ACB46555129076","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1064007002":{"text":"今回は順調にいくといいな……","source_cn":"希望这次能顺利一点……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x47ACB46555129076","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064007003:0":{"text":"おお、それは良かった！","source_cn":"那我就放心了！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x4C614FFA6BCA61CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064007004:0":{"text":"それで、今度はどこに行くの？","source_cn":"那这次，我们要去的地方是什么样的呢？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xFC01B92E50F5261F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1064007004":{"text":"それで、今度はどこに行くの？","source_cn":"那这次，我们要去的地方是什么样的呢？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xFC01B92E50F5261F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064007005:1":{"text":"そこには二つのエリアがあって、一つは地上にあるオルディン村という、ドワーフの職人たちの暮らす村です。","source_cn":"这里有两个区域，一个是地面之上，那里有一个矮人工匠村—...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064007006:1":{"text":"ドワーフか……","source_cn":"矮人啊……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF7233F9348C519DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064007007:1":{"text":"もう一カ所は、地底にあります。今回私たちが行くのも、そこのマグマエリアですよ。","source_cn":"另一个就是地底，我们这次去的就是位于那里的熔岩区。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF9D1F64F37956588","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064007008:1":{"text":"とても変わった場所で、そこには原初の竜がいたんです。","source_cn":"那里很特别，还曾经生活着龙呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x38D33BA3F27E4A64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064007009:1":{"text":"え？竜！？","source_cn":"什么？！龙？！","sta