","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064007018:0":{"text":"だから、何が！？","source_cn":"你又在可惜什么啊？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xABF36B8A78A54202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:33:1064007018":{"text":"だから、何が！？","source_cn":"你又在可惜什么啊？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xABF36B8A78A54202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064007019:1":{"text":"本当か！？竜の卵はまだ見たことがないんだ！","source_cn":"真的吗！？我还没有见过龙蛋！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x6048B03FA59347E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064007020:1":{"text":"竜のような生き物が卵から孵化すると思うと、無性に鳥肌が立つというか……","source_cn":"一想到龙这种生物是从龙蛋里孵化出来，我就忍不住战栗了起来。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1B35AF7ADD66BB29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064007021:1":{"text":"生き物というのは本当に不思議だよな……あんな卵から、とんでもなく強大な存在へと成長するなんて……","source_cn":"生物真的很不可思议呢……竟然能从那样的蛋成长为如此强大...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064007022:1":{"text":"また始まったよ……魔物マニアめ……","source_cn":"又开始