:"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064007028:1":{"text":"これまた、ずいぶんと珍しい組み合わせだな。","source_cn":"真是一个少见的组合啊。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x44A04D3687AC16AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:48:1064007028":{"text":"これまた、ずいぶんと珍しい組み合わせだな。","source_cn":"真是一个少见的组合啊。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x44A04D3687AC16AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064007029:1":{"text":"皆さんがお知り合いになれるのは嬉しいですけど、毎回紹介するのも大変ですね……","source_cn":"虽然能让大家认识很开心，但每次都要介绍也是挺累的呢……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x02157CC89E9D45F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064007030:1":{"text":"そう愚痴るなって。オレなんか、最近は自己紹介しっぱなしだよ。","source_cn":"别抱怨了，我最近可是一直不停的自我介绍呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x413B214C77F8EAD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064007031:1":{"text":"やれ投資だ、運送だ、研究だって、次から次へとやってきてさ、正直もう、うんざりなんだ。","source_cn":"什么投资啊、运输啊、研究啊，接二连三地来，说实话我已经...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064007032:1":{"text":"アンタらを見たときも、てっきりセンシたちを連れて採掘にでも来たのかと思ったよ。","source_cn":"我差点以为你们介绍森西过来采矿呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFADC9B7716297F1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064007033:1":{"text":"……わしは、まあ料理人みたいなものだ。","source_cn":"……老夫，可以说是个厨师之类的人吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE22F96227764D3CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064007034:1":{"text":"へ、へえ。そうなのか。ドワーフにしては……珍しいな。","source_cn":"啊，这样啊。这在矮人中也是挺少见的哈。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4F53CA135E89A7A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064007035:1":{"text":"……話題が見つからなくて気まずくなってるぞ。","source_cn":"……天好像聊死了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x47218F8EAA64E8B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064007036:1":{"text":"え、えっと……わ、私たち、元素エキスを取りに行かなきゃ！","source_cn":"那个，这个……总之我们现在去弄元素精华吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFF029370138E8C86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064007037:1":{"text":"会えてうれしかった、またね、ゾーヤちゃん！","source_cn":"祖娅小妹妹，很高兴认识你，再见！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x74676E523C79C6CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064007038:1":{"text":"あっはははは！やっぱりな！","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈！又来了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAEE36259EE5B91F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1064007039:1":{"text":"こう見えて、オレは数百年生きてるんだぞ。","source_cn":"我可不是小妹妹！我几百岁了哦！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7A35BCE1B4335EFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1064007040:1":{"text":"ドワーフの外見年齢、分からなさすぎだろ……","source_cn":"矮人的年龄也太难分辨了吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7FCD3BEC448B664F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:66:1064007040":{"text":"ドワーフの外見年齢、分からなさすぎだろ……","source_cn":"矮人的年龄也太难分辨了吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7FCD3BEC448B664F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064007041:1":{"text":"ああ、オレのこれは、間違って竜の卵を飲んじまったせいで、成長が止まったんだ。","source_cn":"我这是误服龙蛋液导致的停止生长。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1F6558B11A37D477","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064007042:0":{"text":"卵を！？そんな副作用があるとは……","source_cn":"龙蛋液？！还有这种副作用……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x95F9FF0F64F40BC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064007043:0":{"text":"はあ、また食べられる食材がひとつ減ってしまった。","source_cn":"唉，又少了一种能吃的食材。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x947C38D4C2FB13BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064007044:1":{"text":"……まじで食うつもりだったのかよ！？","source_cn":"……你还真想过吃啊？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC59F3EA9F8560DD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:74:1064007045:1":{"text":"ご、ごめんなさい！てっきり、若いドワーフだとばかり……","source_cn":"啊啊，对不起，我完全没看出来！我以为您只是个年轻矮人！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBF23782BA7797E6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1064007046:1":{"text":"気を悪くさせちゃったのなら、謝るから。","source_cn":"实在太不好意思了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x27D39431AFAD3E0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1064007047:1":{"text":"あははっ、気にすんなって。たまに、初対面のヤツをこうやって驚かすのが楽しんだよ。","source_cn":"嘿嘿，别放在心上。偶尔用这个吓新认识的人一跳，还是挺有...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1064007048:1":{"text":"だから、アンタらのその反応でチャラにしてやんよ。","source_cn":"你们现在的表情也值回票价了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF7BD944003079E86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:78:1064007048":{"text":"だから、アンタらのその反応でチャラにしてやんよ。","source_cn":"你们现在的表情也值回票价了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF7BD944003079E86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064007049:1":{"text":"どっかのピンク頭のとんがり耳のおかげでな。もしかして、アイツに会いに行くのか？","source_cn":"都怪那个粉毛尖耳朵。你们这次不会也要跟他打交道吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x92B59454CA66AB53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1064007050:1":{"text":"とんがり耳？もしかして、エスペリアにもエルフがいるの？","source_cn":"尖耳朵？伊索米亚这里也有精灵吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4EAD5D2E71C572DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1064007051:1":{"text":"エルフ？ああ、確かに似てるかもな……","source_cn":"这么说来，耳朵确实有一点像……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x38AD35026130C557","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1064007052:0":{"text":"正確には、エルフではなくて、ちょっと複雑な過去を持つ種族なんですが……","source_cn":"但准确来说，他们不是精灵。是有着特殊复杂过去的族群……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4040ED98DBA25B1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1064007053:0":{"text":"あんまり楽しい話じゃないからな。","source_cn":"那可不是什么多有意思的事情。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9A575E2B58C73A17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064007054:1":{"text":"まあ、歩きながら話そう。今から、エンバー結晶を取りに行くんだ。","source_cn":"我们边走边聊吧，我准备去采集点暗烬晶体。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xEEE6367FB5927BF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:87:1064007055:1":{"text":"フォンから、カサタケ結晶ポタージュの作り方を教えてもらったんだよ。","source_cn":"芬恩教了我一个新食谱——晶化伞菇浓汤。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4AE7F7368D84B15E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:89:1064007056:1":{"text":"あまり、美味しそうな名前ではないですね……","source_cn":"这名字，听起来不是很好吃……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8781C7F18B561ED7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:90:1064007057:1":{"text":"ははっ！料理は研究と同じだ。形に囚われず、たまには冒険をしないと発見は得られないぞ？","source_cn":"嘿！做菜就像搞研究，不能故步自封。有时候冒险才有惊喜！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x03448A708930609A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:92:1064007058:1":{"text":"同意見だ。わしも迷宮では、様々な魔物の食べ合わせを――","source_cn":"老夫很同意这个说法。在迷宫里，老夫也经常尝试各种魔物组合……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCD58A83E42836B00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:93:1064007059:1":{"text":"ようやく共通の話題を見つけたのか、ゾーヤとセンシは研究と料理の似通っている点について話し始めた。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:94:1064007060:1":{"text":"そして、魔術の昇降機で地下に降り、各自必要な素材を探しに向かった。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:78:0:1":{"text":"どこでそんなこと覚えたんだ？","source_cn":"祖娅，你学坏了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5BE7EA510AB32067","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"どこでそんなこと覚えたんだ？","female":"どこでそんなこと覚えたの？","variant_male_record_index":"59998","variant_female_record_index":"59999","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:66:0:1":{"text":"ゾーヤは特殊なんだ。","source_cn":"祖娅比较特殊","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x32D179453648DFB1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"ゾーヤは特殊なんだ。","female":"ゾーヤは特殊なの。","variant_male_record_index":"59996","variant_female_record_index":"59997","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:48:0:1":{"text":"（ゾーヤに一行を紹介する）","source_cn":"（向祖娅介绍了他们）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD3FEC0BDAEDC40A1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"（ゾーヤに一行を紹介する）","female":"（ゾーヤに一行を紹介する）","variant_male_record_index":"59994","variant_female_record_index":"59995","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:33:0:1":{"text":"竜の卵ならまだ残ってるぞ。","source_cn":"但部分龙蛋还在","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xACDC8E79B59A3C75","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"竜の卵ならまだ残ってるぞ。","female":"竜の卵ならまだ残ってるわよ。","variant_male_record_index":"59992","variant_female_record_index":"59993","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:29:0:1":{"text":"原初の竜は知性を持つ生き物だ。","source_cn":"初始之龙是智慧生物","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5BC8993AC634013C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"原初の竜は知性を持つ生き物だ。","female":"原初の竜は知性を持つ生き物よ。","variant_male_record_index":"59988","variant_female_record_index":"59989","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:29:1:2":{"text":"あれは、神と同等の力を持つ生き物だ。","source_cn":"拥有